<div class="page" style="text-align: left; margin: auto; position: relative; width: 456pt;"><a name="ny20009564x4_424b3_300-bcv_pg1"><!--Anchor--></a><p style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold"><a href="#TOC">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a></p><div class="block-frill" style="width: 456pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div><div class="rule-full" style="height: 0pt; width: 100%; border-bottom: 2pt solid #000000; margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"> </div><div class="rule-full" style="height: 0pt; width: 100%; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; margin-bottom: 1pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; margin-top: 4pt;"> </div></div></div><div class="page-content"><div class="block-main" style="width: 456pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 157.5pt; text-align: center;">FEMASYS INC.<br></div><div class="h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">&#8195;<br></div><div class="h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;"><font style="font-size: 14pt;">3,388,525 Shares</font><br></div><div class="h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;"><font style="font-size: 14pt;">&#8195;</font><br></div><div class="h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;"><font style="font-size: 14pt;">Common Stock</font></div><div><div class="rule-partial" style="height: 0pt; width: 96pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; margin-bottom: 2pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; margin-top: 79.25pt;"> </div></div><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 26.5pt; text-align: center;">PROSPECTUS</div><div><div class="rule-partial" style="height: 0pt; width: 96pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; margin-bottom: 2pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; margin-top: 31.25pt;"> </div></div><div class="h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 224.5pt; text-align: center;">July 14, 2023</div></div></div><div class="block-frill" style="width: 456pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div><div class="rule-full" style="height: 0pt; width: 100%; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"> </div><div class="rule-full" style="height: 0pt; width: 100%; border-bottom: 2pt solid #000000; margin-bottom: 1pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; margin-top: 4pt;"> </div></div></div></div>
